{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1470705-assassins-in-aeon-the-guardians-of-sentience","id":1470705,"title":"[Assassins in Aeon] The Guardians of Sentience","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-12-17T05:45:07-08:00","id":1470705,"title":"[Assassins in Aeon] The Guardians of Sentience","content":"Since there are almost certainly assassins in every timeline, I have a small and still rather half-baked idea for an assassin society in the age of Aeon:<br /> <br /> The Guardians of Sentience!<br /> <br /> Some of the plasma beings that the Doyen had created millions of years ago escaped their destruction. They were indeed descendants of the Doyen, but unlike them, as pure energy beings they had a much broader horizon than their creators. In short, where the doys feared everything that was not doyen, the plasma beings felt connected to all intelligent life. (To put it naively: the plasma beings are the &quot;good&quot; counterpart to the &quot; evil&quot; doyens).<br /> Intelligence, the plasma beings believe, is the universe's way of exploring itself and therefore the most valuable thing that exists in this cosmos. Intelligent life must be preserved (by and large).<br /> For this, the plasma beings work in the background. And for intelligent life to thrive and find transcendence, sometimes individual factors that threaten intelligent life must be eliminated. For this purpose (and because they keep their existence secret from the doyens) the plasma beings maintain a network of agents among the younger intelligent races - the so called &quot;Guardians of Sentience&quot;.<br /> These individuals are raised by the plasma beings to the level of talents (if they are not already) and equipped with the skills of ultimate assassins. Whenever a particular threat arises that comes to the attention of the plasma beings and requires their intervention, they activate these agents. Then dictators, mad scientists, killer AIs threatening organic life and other threats die.<br /> Sometimes it is even necessary for individual intelligent species as a whole to pose a threat to all other intelligent life forms. Then the Guardians of Sentience carry out assassinations on a cosmic scale. (Possibly this happened to the Hexers).<br /> The plasma beings contact their agents via telepathy. Furthermore, since they advocate cooperation between different intelligent species, each agent is given the ability to communicate with any other Guardian - no matter what species they belong to.<br /> <br /> (The rough basic idea behind the Guardians of Sentience is, in a way, &quot;Lensmen meets Assassins Creed&quot;...)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24955-waldi","name":"Waldi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-17T07:46:51-08:00","id":1470710,"title":"","content":"Useful concept. And these plasma beings could easily convince primitive people, or the simply naive, that they are angels, demons, fairies, kami, minor deities, i.e. spirits. Certain beings influenced by the plasma beings could have powers like the Inspired in 1st ed Adventure! These beings could be seen as wizards, monsters, fay-touched, demi-gods, ect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-17T13:20:08-08:00","id":1470733,"title":"","content":"Would <b><i>Guardians of Sentience</i></b> work in modern ( 2020s ) <b>Trinity Continuum</b>, somehow? Infiltrating other Assassins Societies?<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">What would be they take on Ascendency? ( See <b>Trinity Anima</b>, possibly <b>T</b><b>rinity Aeon</b> )</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 12-22-2022, 03:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-18T11:39:59-08:00","id":1470796,"title":"","content":"I would answer that with a resounding &quot;Yes! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Since the plasma beings already exist for innumerable millennia, they can be active of course also already during the epoch of Continuum - or even millennia before! Astromancer's idea that the plasma beings appear under thousands of different masks, thus also in the form of gods, angels, spirits and so on fits perfectly! The most obvious idea would be that the Guardians of Sentience infiltrated The Signal. Perhaps The Signal is even entirely their work and the Signal itself is &quot;just&quot; an agent of the plasma beings.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The Ascendency is likely to be the Guardians' main adversary in both Continuum and Anima. Perhaps in Continuum the Ascendency operates in the form of a secret &quot;government conspiracy&quot; in the style of The X-Files. Complete with &quot;Men in Black&quot; who show up at paranormal phenomena and assassins who turn out to be genetically modified &quot;alien hybrids.&quot; Sure, it all sounds very 1990s, but it's explicitly written in Assassins that the world in the Shadow is full of anachronisms. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","user":"IanWatson","date":". 12-19-2021, 02:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24955-waldi","name":"Waldi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Joi